From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:14:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 088/260] [ae-patch] Show every sidebar row's waiting state and
 agent count, not only the selected session's

The list row's status rolls up busy direct children, so only the open chat could tell a session whose own turn ended from one still working. SessionListItem now carries turn_active (the session's own turn, no child rollup) and blocked_on (the dialog a running session is parked on, cached from its latest status edge). The sidebar row and the collapsed project marker read both, so an unselected row shows the waiting state with its agent count and never turns quiet while parked on a dialog. A server without the fields keeps the old behavior.
